    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit one of <strong>3 classes</strong> of hero to enter the mountain and collect Foepower from the growing horde of corrupted monsters. Receive <strong>dynamic level-up choices</strong>, hunt for <strong>powerful equipment</strong>, and bump into <strong>unique encounters</strong> offering a fresh and fun level up experience for each playthrough.<br><br>Your recruited hero runs go from Level 1 to Level 30, designed for <strong>quick in-and-out gameplay</strong>. Each round of <strong>auto-battling exploration</strong> takes 30-90 seconds, with the total run requiring less than 30 minutes. Your run to level 30 is timed during active combat, offering a <strong>speed run competition</strong> versus your own best performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRINKMANSHIP! (How far will YOU push it?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to balance how careful or aggressive to be, as you balance <strong>harvesting Foepower</strong>, experience, and loot, versus escaping <strong>increasingly difficult monsters</strong> and the <strong>effects of the mountain's corruption</strong>. As you gather more Foepower, you can <strong>invest in troupe-wide Foepower traits</strong> to strengthen all your heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEST YOUR CHAMPIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 30, your heroes compete to become an <strong>arena champion</strong>. In the arena, you can <strong>battle increasingly strong bosses</strong>, and gain <strong>additional arena level up powers</strong>.<br><br>You can also test your newest hero versus your best hero of that class (Warrior, Mage, or Inquisitor). Its a <strong>king of the hill match</strong> - the best wins and can <strong>loot an item from the fallen</strong>.<br><br>Your arena champions can also train new recruits allowing for a type of <strong>multi-classing hero</strong>, enabling new gameplay variations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit one of <strong>3 classes</strong> of hero to enter the mountain and collect Foepower from the growing horde of corrupted monsters. Receive <strong>dynamic level-up choices</strong>, hunt for <strong>powerful equipment</strong>, and bump into <strong>unique encounters</strong> offering a fresh and fun level up experience for each playthrough.<br><br>Your recruited hero runs go from Level 1 to Level 30, designed for <strong>quick in-and-out gameplay</strong>. Each round of <strong>auto-battling exploration</strong> takes 30-90 seconds, with the total run requiring less than 30 minutes. Your run to level 30 is timed during active combat, offering a <strong>speed run competition</strong> versus your own best performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRINKMANSHIP! (How far will YOU push it?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to balance how careful or aggressive to be, as you balance <strong>harvesting Foepower</strong>, experience, and loot, versus escaping <strong>increasingly difficult monsters</strong> and the <strong>effects of the mountain's corruption</strong>. As you gather more Foepower, you can <strong>invest in troupe-wide Foepower traits</strong> to strengthen all your heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEST YOUR CHAMPIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 30, your heroes compete to become an <strong>arena champion</strong>. In the arena, you can <strong>battle increasingly strong bosses</strong>, and gain <strong>additional arena level up powers</strong>.<br><br>You can also test your newest hero versus your best hero of that class (Warrior, Mage, or Inquisitor). Its a <strong>king of the hill match</strong> - the best wins and can <strong>loot an item from the fallen</strong>.<br><br>Your arena champions can also train new recruits allowing for a type of <strong>multi-classing hero</strong>, enabling new gameplay variations.</p>",
    "short_description": "Foepower is a chill (but often spicy) roguelite auto-battle RPG - now with a chalk art pack drawn by the dev's daughter! Send heroes into the mountain to level up, gear up, and extract the all-important Foepower - because you'll need it to strengthen your next hero and move up the leaderboards!",
